Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.96,0:00:12.00,OpeningQuote,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(2000,0)}Change your desires rather than the order of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:12.00,QuoteAttribution,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,0)\q2\pos(575,250)}René Descartes, "Discourse on the Method"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:18.38,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0}Graduation Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:18.38,Main,MC,0,0,0,,Representing the graduating students,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.72,0:00:21.87,Main,MC,0,0,0,,Horikita Manabu of Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.73,0:00:27.71,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Our reply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:31.87,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,On this day, when the fragrance of plum \Nconveys to us the first breath of spring,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:35.69,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,we accomplished our graduation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.51,0:00:40.75,Main_Top,Manabu,0,0,0,,Three years ago, we entered \NAdvanced Nurturing High School,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.22,0:00:43.13,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Despite Nagumo's interference, \Nhe maintained Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:43.90,Main_Top,Manabu,0,0,0,,and I clearly remember swearing to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.28,0:00:49.78,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,that I would make sure these three \Nyears would be worthwhile ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:53.45,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Through competition and hard work,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:56.42,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,we survived the many special exams we faced,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:01:02.47,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,and today, I am grateful to be \Nable to graduate with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.67,0:01:09.69,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,The resolute efforts of those comrades \Nwho are no longer with us, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.05,0:01:12.36,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,were not in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:17.47,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Their noble visages remain \Ninscribed deeply on our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:23.07,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I ensure you, here and now, \Nthat what you learn at this school
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.07,0:01:27.57,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,will be a treasure for your future, \Nand will be of great use to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.18,0:01:31.33,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Those of you who currently have doubts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.33,0:01:34.32,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,must continue to step forward without fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:37.21,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,You must believe that when you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:41.34,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,the world that seems cold and closed off \Nnow will greet you with gentle warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.82,0:01:45.65,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Next year, and the year after,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:48.63,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,whoever is to stand here making \Nthat graduate address—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.63,0:01:52.38,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,you will surely have a moment \Nwhen you understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.09,0:01:56.48,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Thank you sincerely for \Nthese past three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.81,0:02:01.17,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Horikita Manabu, speaking on \Nbehalf of the graduating class.
