Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:36.50,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Now, before tomorrow's end-of-term ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:39.79,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,we'll have a simple review of this term.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:42.81,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,I'll start by saying you performed admirably
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.27,0:03:46.51,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,against Class A in the final special exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.55,0:03:53.39,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,It's a massive difference from how you were \Nwhen you first arrived here one year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.39,0:03:57.92,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,But, Sensei, we've fallen back to Class D.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.92,0:04:01.38,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,Totally back to square one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.38,0:04:04.89,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,After all our hard work \Nmaking it to Class C...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:06.41,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:09.99,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,You did fall to Class D, it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.99,0:04:13.54,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,But you have grown a tremendous \Namount in this past year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.27,0:04:19.92,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,In terms of class points, \Nyou gained the most out of everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:23.63,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,It's kinda scary when \Nyou praise us that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:25.71,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,This isn't leading to a catch, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.71,0:04:27.18,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,It is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.61,0:04:31.18,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,But the other classes have grown, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.18,0:04:37.15,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Whether or not you're able to \Nsurpass them in the days to come
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.15,0:04:41.60,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,will be determined by whether or not \Nyou can maintain your hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:46.70,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,The graduation party will be today, \Nbut although there is no class today,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.08,0:04:51.22,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,do not forget that it is still a school day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.87,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It sounds like you struggled \Nwith the final exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.51,0:05:01.19,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I think Ryuen-kun's strategy \Ntotally got in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:04.81,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,The result is that Class B lost badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.81,0:05:08.73,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I hear a lot of students \Nsuddenly called out sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:10.14,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:14.64,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It was clearly a trap set by Ryuen-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:14.64,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs16\bord0\shad0\fay.2\frx16\fry6\move(355,40,329,47)}Final Special Exam
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:17.21,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But the greatest cause of our defeat
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:19.90,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,was my inability to make \Na psychological comeback
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.19,0:05:21.80,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,as the captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:22.90,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\an8\fay.21\pos(365.333,-3)\frx22\fry356}Round 6
