Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.12,0:13:26.91,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:29.70,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Well? Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.00,0:13:32.37,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.68,0:13:35.47,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The way you were before, \Nyou probably wouldn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.47,0:13:36.84,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:40.55,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm still me. I haven't changed at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:49.85,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Even if you don't graduate in Class A, \Nit must feel nice to graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:52.56,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Even if you don't get a \Nshortcut to your dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.96,0:13:55.93,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,maybe you can still carve a \Npath under your own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.79,0:14:02.37,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:06.00,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Use your special privilege as little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.00,0:14:07.47,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.97,0:14:14.00,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,For me to run to my brother's side now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.00,0:14:15.29,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It feels unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:17.99,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Rather... it feels inappropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.84,0:14:21.88,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm not chickening out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.25,0:14:26.15,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I wanted to see my brother's \Nthree years here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.15,0:14:27.35,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,That's why I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:31.23,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:33.89,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I've done what I came here to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.31,0:14:35.37,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.77,0:14:38.52,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm staying a little while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:39.66,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.66,0:14:40.71,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Goodbye, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:56.16,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Were you waiting for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:15:02.54,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I thought this might be my \Nlast chance to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:05.63,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,It seems Suzune has left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.30,0:15:11.12,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,She said she wanted to get a \Nlook at your three years here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.29,0:15:19.13,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Sorry. Maybe I should have done \Nmore on the student council thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:21.45,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.50,0:15:25.32,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I'm leaving the school on the 31st.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:29.69,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Tell Suzune to meet me by the \Nfront gate at noon that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:32.82,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you tell her yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.15,0:15:35.28,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I want you to convince her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:39.06,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,There's a chance she might \Nnot be honest with herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:16.24,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,Today is my brother's last day at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:22.17,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I wasn't able to show \Nhim my growth this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.63,0:16:26.95,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,Is it all right for us to part like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.69,0:16:34.73,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm still the foolish little sister \Nwho just chased after her big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:37.59,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,A fake...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.35,0:16:39.99,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:45.40,Italics,Horikita,0,0,0,,What I really wanted my brother to see was...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.36,0:16:57.41,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:16:58.87,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,To the fake
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.21,0:17:04.80,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,and the unquestionably real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.69,0:17:38.93,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm afraid your sister isn't here yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.60,0:17:40.72,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.20,0:17:49.23,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji, why are you \Nhiding your own talent?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.59,0:17:53.59,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I just don't like standing out, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.24,0:18:00.22,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Do you think living your school life \Nunder the radar is really worthwhile?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:06.65,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,You came to this school to make \Nsome kind of mark, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.99,0:18:08.84,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Make a mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:13.86,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I think that's something only \Nshining people like you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.86,0:18:17.47,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,If you can't make your \Nmark on the school itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.99,0:18:20.15,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,you can make it on the students.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:25.55,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,If you engrave on the minds of \Nthe students that a student
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.55,0:18:27.50,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,named Ayanokoji Kiyotaka was here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.50,0:18:29.94,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I don't think they'll forget \Nit all their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:34.29,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for what \Nyou've done for my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:39.21,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,But I've realized I'm the kind of \Nman who expects more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.88,0:18:40.76,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,That is why
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.26,0:18:44.51,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I don't want you disappointing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.63,0:18:48.41,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.77,0:18:50.13,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,That's all I ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:53.04,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,The answer you find will guide you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.41,0:18:56.25,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I should be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.53,0:18:59.96,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to cause you trouble \Nright up until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:04.28,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Are you sure you shouldn't call \Nyour sister one last time?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:10.12,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,No, a moment of inappropriate emotion \Nfrom me might inhibit her growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.66,0:19:12.95,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Forgive me for pushing it on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:15.44,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,but I will leave Suzune in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.01,0:19:24.69,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Let us meet again, Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.45,0:19:37.51,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.51,0:19:48.33,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:52.27,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,You seem to have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.71,0:20:03.47,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Rather... you've returned to the \Nperson you were then, Suzune.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.47,0:20:04.68,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It took me a year...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.13,0:20:08.72,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,No, many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.17,0:20:20.65,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I want to keep on walking forward, \Nfor the sake of my classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.36,0:20:25.68,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,And in order to find my own path,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.68,0:20:28.74,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep learning \Nalongside my classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.74,0:20:33.50,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,It sounds like you really have returned \Nto the person you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:40.92,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Do you know my primary reason \Nfor pushing you away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:41.97,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:45.26,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,You were caught up in the illusion of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.26,0:20:48.47,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I simply couldn't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.01,0:20:52.89,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,But you'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.33,0:20:55.35,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I'm sure of that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.98,0:21:01.28,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Be strong with others, and also kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:02.11,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:05.74,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I must also apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.57,0:21:11.62,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I lied back then, when I \Nsaid I preferred long hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:16.75,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,You always liked having short hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.75,0:21:20.13,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,so I lied to see if you'd \Ntake it seriously or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.79,0:21:23.13,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:30.23,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.71,0:21:35.65,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I think your lie is the \Nreason I'm here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.02,0:21:40.63,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Suzune, I care about you greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:43.36,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.28,0:21:48.44,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting for you outside \Nthis gate in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.87,0:21:52.29,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Show me how much you've grown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.29,0:21:55.22,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I will. I'll do all I can
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.22,0:21:58.42,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,and fight to the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.07,0:22:00.02,Main,Manabu,0,0,0,,Let us meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.71,0:22:01.55,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Yes.
